<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4594" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλόγιστ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inconsiderate, thought-less,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόλμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.82
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					574
				</span></i>
			; of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir.</u>
				p.97
			</span></i> W. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>thoughtlessly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					7.12
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				2.29
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαπανᾶν ἀ. βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					623
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>irrational,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				37c
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογιστικός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				439d
			</span></i>, al.; <i>foolish, unthinking,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir.</u>
				p.97
			</span></i> W.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῦτος ἀ. προσλαβὼν ἐξουσίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					665
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.</span>
			<i>unreason,</i> i.e. <i>chance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.99
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.45
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				324b
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>incalculable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1675
			</span></i> (lyr.); <i>indefinite, indeterminate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>in Prm.</u>
					p.547
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not to be accounted, vile,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1156
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				75
			</span></i>.</div>
